       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PIPEDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BALANCE     PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 1000.00.
       01  WS-RATE        PIC S9V9(4)  COMP-3 VALUE 0.0125.
       01  WS-INTEREST    PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-MONTH       PIC 9(2)     VALUE 0.
       01  WS-EDITED      PIC $$$,$$9.99-.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM ACCRUE-PARA VARYING WS-MONTH FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-MONTH > 3.
           MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-EDITED.
           DISPLAY 'FINAL BALANCE ' WS-EDITED.
           STOP RUN.
       ACCRUE-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED = WS-BALANCE * WS-RATE.
           ADD WS-INTEREST TO WS-BALANCE.
           MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-EDITED.
           DISPLAY 'MONTH ' WS-MONTH ' BALANCE ' WS-EDITED.
